_lAKhYCpMErUQ7EsYM10G8l9AyESw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD8XPXHi7sqUJ-elkpyh4w6WtHNdttja5F4sCV224xO9Q&oe=6A5A1240"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-104346.png", "id": "1910051799596938", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1910051802930271_5093697632380196663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jw6lsNZL7vUQ7kNvwF9_2VM&_nc_oc=AdoRWfW0yBgU1647QIxHpnURIGjQmXf8wvVYmu7Ol_RLkCJf6C3akSmWgOMYHql6s-A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD23cajFdsnaNk1LkDFvciO1ofTfvyiLkZKypaKH3tgdw&oe=6A5A259B"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-103557.png", "id": "1406115264546505", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1406115267879838_2631368577935749496_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Db_lz8MNLz0Q7kNvwGuM1Z3&_nc_oc=AdpZ5GccahTeGzuiodIwJOE_K325vK2EbRJf9CbEp_wbNDnQpOvD4Bi-HsBDaLek_8c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD4nRjRPHY1OTClaWK6noymdqAq7EPJ6fSlU3o2b8QtOg&oe=6A5A456D"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-111655.png", "id": "911517787897938", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_911517791231271_4588332304987211788_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3CvJWMQ4SskQ7kNvwEse9yk&_nc_oc=AdpS4Er8fnK4eGZdjEk_PWygkLF2jdPlLfoSH7Mebv7OOldD0soCJ0pv5JduUfgzvfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCLePyexm8et4HegmnpeRgc5BiqOFl84E8984hO0L9REA&oe=6A5A1E1A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-07-18-14h53m09s181.png", "id": "24523165587385059", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821115_24523165607385057_3752300522125326141_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a5ceNBCTVHQQ7kNvwGF67Xt&_nc_oc=AdqgSJ7nPedCmmk6_B8XIC8qcec3e3OMwzTKLbr0FNUB_rllu9-rFQ883jJDtwosrkc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCQ_NzmmYCmG1MncEpPMI30MMw18RLkxy5U2H2ck4d-SQ&oe=6A5A30C0"}, "display_name": "Forgotten Possessions", "keywords": ["horror", "stealth", "survival", "scary", "psychological"], "long_description": "**They say some things are better left forgotten. In this cabin, they are hunting you.**\n\nForgotten Possessions is a raw, physics-based VR horror experience crafted by a solo developer. No hand-holding. No safety net. Just you, your flashlight, and the crushing weight of the silence.\n\n# WHY YOU WILL FEAR THE DARK:\n\n- **Ever-Changing Nightmare:** Item locations and scares are randomized. Every run is a fresh descent into madness\u2014you never know where the next item hides or where the entity will strike.\n- **The Guardian:** A relentless AI that listens and hunts. It reacts to your noise and tracks your last known position. Silence is your only weapon.\n- **Unravel the Truth:** Explore the cabin to find hidden collectibles and piece together a dark, forgotten history. Each run reveals more of the story.\n- **Scoring Mode:** Beat your high score and test your stealth and survival skills in a franatical collecting run!\n\n# PLANNED FEATURES FOR FULL RELEASE (NOT GUARANTEED)\n\n- **Difficulty Modifiers or Difficulty Selection:** A new mode where the AI gets stronger as you progress OR a mode where you select AI modifiers yourself. ", "short_description": "Find and collect items that tell a dark story in an abandoned log cabin, but watch out for what lurks behind you. You sneak through dark rooms against a relentless, adaptive creature. Forget combat\u2014patience and stealth are your only mission. Experience a dynamic world with randomized item locations and a reactive environment. Evade the guardian as it reacts to noise and hunts you. Piece by piece, reveal the chilling past and examine items in your personal safe room."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://glock-software.de/privacy.html", "developer_terms_o